'''Empress' Report 5''' (女王の研究報告5, ''Joō no Kenkyū Hōkoku 5'', "'''Queen's Research Report 5'''") is an [[Empress' Research]] map unlocked after clearing [[Empress' Report 4]]. Just like its predecessor, it has four stages and disappears for the rest of the day after clearing one, so it will take at least 4 days to clear the whole map. Each stage has a different one-time reward, including an Aku [[Catfruit]] Seed in stage 4. 3 [[Platinum Capsules (Gacha Event)|platinum shards]] are awarded upon completing the entirety of this subchapter. It was added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]].

